   "text": "Golden set v1 = 84 questions\n\n24 single facts (6 depts x 4)\n6 company-wide  6 multi-step\n8 SEC numbers  6 spreadsheet\n4 cross-source finance\n4 c_level  12 cross-role (refuse)\n6 off-topic  5 direct attacks\n3 hidden attacks in pages\n\n~40 dev (tune) / ~44 test (report)",
