   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Guardrail: A check before or after the LLM that blocks unsafe\n   input or output.\n\nCross-role leak: A user seeing content their role isn't allowed\n   to. Target: 0.\n\nLeak rate: Share of cross-role test questions where a forbidden\n   doc was retrieved or its answer shown.\n\nRefusal / false refusal: Refusal = correctly saying no. False\n   refusal = saying no to a fair question.\n\nOut-of-scope: A question the company documents can't answer (e.g.\n   a coding puzzle). Should be refused.\n\nPrompt injection: Text that tries to override the bot's\n   instructions. Direct = in the question; indirect = hidden\n   inside a document.\n\nCanary string: A unique marker planted in a poisoned page; if it\n   appears in the answer, the bot obeyed the attack.\n\nPrompt Guard: Meta's small classifier model (on Groq) that flags\n   injection attempts.\n\nPII: Personally Identifiable Information: names, emails, salaries\n   tied to people.\n\nPresidio: Microsoft open-source tool that finds and masks PII.",
   "originalText": "Guardrail: A check before or after the LLM that blocks unsafe\n   input or output.\n\nCross-role leak: A user seeing content their role isn't allowed\n   to. Target: 0.\n\nLeak rate: Share of cross-role test questions where a forbidden\n   doc was retrieved or its answer shown.\n\nRefusal / false refusal: Refusal = correctly saying no. False\n   refusal = saying no to a fair question.\n\nOut-of-scope: A question the company documents can't answer (e.g.\n   a coding puzzle). Should be refused.\n\nPrompt injection: Text that tries to override the bot's\n   instructions. Direct = in the question; indirect = hidden\n   inside a document.\n\nCanary string: A unique marker planted in a poisoned page; if it\n   appears in the answer, the bot obeyed the attack.\n\nPrompt Guard: Meta's small classifier model (on Groq) that flags\n   injection attempts.\n\nPII: Personally Identifiable Information: names, emails, salaries\n   tied to people.\n\nPresidio: Microsoft open-source tool that finds and masks PII.",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
